{"id":"puskaj","lemma":"пускай","pos":"conj","rank":1758,"glosses":["same as пусть (pustʹ)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8a/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%83%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%83%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Не пускай никого в комнату.","en":"Don't let anyone into the room.","words":[{"g":"not"},null,null,{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Не пускай всё на самотёк.","en":"Don't leave everything to chance.","words":[{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Не пускай сюда Тома.","en":"Keep Tom away from here.","words":[{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"here, hither"},{"g":"volume","l":"том"}]},{"text":"Пожалуйста, не пускай Тома за руль.","en":"Please don't let Tom drive.","words":[{"g":"please"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"volume","l":"том"},{"g":"behind / for"},{"g":"rudder"}]},{"text":"Не пускай Тома за руль.","en":"Don't let Tom drive.","words":[{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"volume","l":"том"},{"g":"behind / for"},{"g":"rudder"}]}]}